part rates
  tally 2
  note "Daily and monthly rates the texts read: the CBL mid rate FX-FLR (gazette.csv, GEN-4), Bank Lazur's buy rate for the floren (market/lazur-fx-flr.csv, its Buy column; C-HR2 .4, C-HR9 .1) and the RNB reference rate of the dukat (rosvald-gazette.csv, RGP-3, florens for 100 dukats). Each figure is published on its own day, so each row is known on it; a day with no row is a hole."

input fx_mid[d in day]: num DUK/FLR question "What is the CBL mid rate FX-FLR of this day (GEN-4 .1)?"

input lazur_buy[d in day]: num DUK/FLR question "What is Bank Lazur's buy rate for the floren on this day?"

input rnb_duk100[m in month]: num FLR/DUK question "What is the RNB reference rate of the dukat for this month, in florens for 100 dukats (RGP-3)?"

version fx_flr_rows
  cite gazette
  governs always
  known 2024-01-02
